owcasters, they are rather resistant to regular Originium Arts.","abilities":["Refraction"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.7,"stats":{"hp":4000,"atk":380,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.4}},"dublinn_phalanx_commander":{"slug":"dublinn_phalanx_commander","name":"Dublinn Phalanx Commander","icon":"/enemies-icons/Dublinn Phalanx Commander.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A phalanx commander in the Dublinn forces, they organize the infantry under their command into phalanx formations. The phalanx tactics they utilize evolved from the combat formations used in Gaul. In the phalanx, nearby infantry will support one another, increasing the might of the formation.","abilities":["When other Phalanx Commanders are nearby, DEF increases (stacks)","Refraction"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":6000,"atk":450,"def":400,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.5}},"dublinn_scout_leader":{"slug":"dublinn_scout_leader","name":"Dublinn Scout Leader","icon":"/enemies-icons/Dublinn Scout Leader.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A scout leader in the Dublinn forces. The scouts under their command are the cornerstone of the Dublinn forces' guerilla maneuvers. Equipped with a refractive mask crafted by Shadowcasters, they are rather resistant to regular Originium Arts.","abilities":["Refraction"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":4400,"atk":380,"def":180,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"dublinn_heavy_defender_leader":{"slug":"dublinn_heavy_defender_leader","name":"Dublinn Heavy Defender Leader","icon":"/enemies-icons/